import CriticalGK2.PaperCriticalEndpoint

/-!
# The Kurosh problem at Gelfand–Kirillov dimension two

The library constructs an infinite-dimensional, two-generated, positively
graded prime nil algebra of GK dimension two over every field. Nilpotence
persists under arbitrary field extensions and finite matrix constructions.
The same algebra supplies the algebraic unitization theorem.

The main existence theorems are in `CriticalGK2.PrimeCriticalEndpoint`,
`CriticalGK2.PrimeCriticalDefault`, and `CriticalGK2.PaperCriticalEndpoint`.
-/
